[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2280.95, "timestamp": "00:38:00", "text": "自分のことをするように心がけています。   それでも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2284.71, "timestamp": "00:38:04", "text": "、私はできるだけ親しい人たちと付き合うようにしていると"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2286.887, "timestamp": "00:38:06", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "lol"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2289.589, "timestamp": "00:38:09", "text": "思う。 でも、私はいつも愚痴をこぼして相手を困らせてしまう傾向があると思う。だって、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2300.95, "timestamp": "00:38:20", "text": "実際には"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2301.229, "timestamp": "00:38:21", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I mean to make your friends you gotta put yourself out there"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2305.51, "timestamp": "00:38:25", "text": "誰にも"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2309.589, "timestamp": "00:38:29", "text": "相談できる人がいないって気づいたからだよね？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2311.589, "timestamp": "00:38:31", "text": "私がたくさん話したり、たくさん喋ったりできる唯一の場所は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2316.069, "timestamp": "00:38:36", "text": "私の配信だけですよね"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2319.109, "timestamp": "00:38:39", "text": "？ たとえ現実世界でも、ほとんどの人は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2320.63, "timestamp": "00:38:40", "text": "私の言っていることを理解してくれないだろう"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2323.186, "timestamp": "00:38:43", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "you can expect to find new friends by sitting at home all day, gotta go out there and socialize you know?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2325.27, "timestamp": "00:38:45", "text": "。なぜなら、彼らは私の言っていることのほとんどを知らないからだ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2328.71, "timestamp": "00:38:48", "text": "ええと、たとえそれがバーチャル開催であっても、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2330.47, "timestamp": "00:38:50", "text": "もちろんそれについて話すことはできますが、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2334.79, "timestamp": "00:38:54", "text": "どうでしょう。 ええ、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2336.55, "timestamp": "00:38:56", "text": "もちろん、それについて話すと"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2337.673, "timestamp": "00:38:57", "author": "@LordHeadAss002", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/-EWTr8l_W5L2rvpeIbbmfhhB0C_JFG5p8g68fFdW2VO7paKednRMpYHY2A7J0gqpYJkgYp2Vnw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "all good things in life take effort"}]